      "content": "wait lol what? \"secret society of goblins\"? u rly just went off the rails there. i don't think i can send an email to a dev saying they didn't fit in with our \"goblin\" vibe... that's gonna look super weird. \n\ncan u please just finish the email and try to make it sound professional again? just focus on the \"unique team culture\" part without any of the weird creature stuff. i just need to get this sent out.",
